{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-cl_yure",
  "id": "source-39301",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39301001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "荒野行动，需要时刻保存体力，所以……吃很重要！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "看，我随身携带着各种口味的调料包，还有各种各样的锅具！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "嗯哼，我很聪明吧？星洛一直都很聪明哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗！噗噗！！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "不过，星洛还从来没有吃过像你这样圆润可爱的小猪猪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "怎么做才能让你变得美味又可口呢，唔，有点伤脑筋呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "有了有了！是时候拿出星洛的「超级料理神器」了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一台崭新的烤肉架摆在了「牡丹」的面前。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗！？噗噗噗！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "这个叫作烤肉架，用它制作烤乳猪，一定一定会非常美味~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "哇哦，星洛都要等不及了，现在就开始制作烤乳猪吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗噗噗噗——噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "小猪猪，乖乖过来这里，星洛会把你洗白白哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "不要不好意思地躲来躲去啦，星洛要生气咯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一本厚厚的字典从空中飞来，砸在了烤肉架上。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "呜，我辛辛苦苦搭好的烤肉架……是谁？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "嗯，就是你把「牡丹」偷走的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39301018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗！噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
